<title>UK: Credit Local sets $300 mln four-year bond.</title>
<headline>Credit Local sets $300 mln four-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers ABN AMRO Hoare Govett and DKB International.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CREDIT LOCAL DE FRANCE</p>
<p> AMT    $300 MLN	COUPON     6.5	 MATURITY    16.JUL.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.325   PAY DATE    16.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.625     REOFFER    99.925    SPREAD	+22 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AA1	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA+	 DENOMS (K) ONE	 SALE LIMITS US/UK/FR</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  FRAMCE    TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.225     SELL CONC  1.40	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF MTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
